        <mxCell id="PDqnr-slGXtAOqznoVA2-12" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="120" x="120" y="1340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PDqnr-slGXtAOqznoVA2-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Design a Hotstar like application with following requiremnets:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.User Login Service&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2.Subscribe Service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3.Movie / Tv Show seacrh Service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;4.Movie / Tv show Play Service.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Optimize the application using cdc Pipeline, Highlight where proxy design pattern can be used.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Use HLS and DASH for specific live/static content playing along with manifest file.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="390" x="50" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PDqnr-slGXtAOqznoVA2-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Functional Requirements :&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. User Should able to login and Signup .&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. User Should able to search the Services .&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. User should able to subscribe to the application.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. User should able to rate the videos.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. User should able to filter out videos according to need.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. User should able to share the video to other users.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The system supports search, recommendations, and channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Non-Functional Requirements :&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Application should handle 1.5 million active users.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. (CAP theorm) Availiability &amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt; consistency&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;The application should be available for billlion user instead of being consistency .&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Latency - 100-150 ms&lt;br&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Video playback should start quickly and switch quality without noticeable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;buffering. Even at low bandwidth&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="560" x="20" y="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PDqnr-slGXtAOqznoVA2-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="API EndPoints&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. User login&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;POST /api/user/register : post the user into the database;&lt;br&gt;POST /api/user/Login : Verify the username and password in the database.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2.Application Subscription&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;POST /api/user/subscription : post the user details for subscription in the database;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;DELETE /api/user/subscription : user wants to delete the subscription.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Search Service&lt;br&gt;GET /api/Movies-tv? seach_movies=&quot;movie_name&quot; - to search the movie from movie name.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Play Service&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;GET /api/Movies-tv? play_movies=&quot;movie_name&quot; - to search the movie from movie name.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="540" x="20" y="650" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
